/* PcccMapper.selectCustomsCodeVerificationInfo : 개인통관부호 검증 전송 데이터 조회 */ SELECT TOP 1 od.ENT_CODE ,od.OD_JOB_NO ,od.HBL_NO
,dbo.Cryptography(od.OD_JOB_NO, od.CONSIGNEE_HP_ENC, 1) AS ORIG_CONSIGNEE_HP ,dbo.Cryptography(od.OD_JOB_NO, od.CONSIGNEE_TEL_ENC, 1) AS ORIG_CONSIGNEE_TEL ,dbo.Cryptography(od.OD_JOB_NO, od.CUSTOMS_ID_ENC, 1) AS ORIG_CUSTOMS_ID
,od.CONSIGNEE_HP AS ORIG_CONSIGNEE_HP ,od.CONSIGNEE_TEL AS ORIG_CONSIGNEE_TEL ,od.CUSTOMS_ID AS ORIG_CUSTOMS_ID
,od.CONSIGNEE_NAME_LOC AS ORIG_CONSIGNEE_NAME ,od.CONSIGNEE_FIRST_NAME as ORIG_CONSIGNEE_F_NAME ,od.CONSIGNEE_LAST_NAME as ORIG_CONSIGNEE_L_NAME ,od.CONSIGNEE_ZIPCODE AS ORIG_CONSIGNEE_ZIPCODE FROM TB_ECM_OD od LEFT JOIN TB_ECM_OD_ADDITIONAL ad ON od.OD_JOB_NO = ad.OD_JOB_NO WHERE 1=1
AND od.ENT_CODE = #{srchEntCode}
AND od.OD_JOB_NO = #{odJobNo}
AND (od.HBL_NO = #{srchNo} OR od.PO_NO = #{srchNo})
AND ${srchNoType} = #{srchNo}
AND od.BOUND_TYPE = #{boundType}

